.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH excise 1  "excise 1.0.2"
.SH NAME
excise
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBexcise\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-a\fR|\fB\-\-apparent\-size\fR] [\fB\-\-scan\-threads\fR] [\fB\-\-event\-buffer\fR] [\fB\-\-cross\-filesystems\fR] [\fB\-\-exclude\fR] [\fB\-\-memory\-mib\fR] [\fB\-\-reduced\-motion\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\fR] [\fB\-\-ascii\fR] [\fB\-\-mouse\fR] [\fB\-\-keymap\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-d\fR|\fB\-\-disable\-delete\-confirmation\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIfolder\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Read configuration from FILE
.TP
\fB\-a\fR, \fB\-\-apparent\-size\fR
Show apparent file sizes instead of allocated bytes
.TP
\fB\-\-scan\-threads\fR \fI<COUNT>\fR
Scanner worker count (1\-32)
.TP
\fB\-\-event\-buffer\fR \fI<COUNT>\fR
Bounded worker\-event capacity (16\-4096)
.TP
\fB\-\-cross\-filesystems\fR
Permit traversal across filesystem boundaries
.TP
\fB\-\-exclude\fR \fI<PATTERN>\fR
Ordered gitignore\-style exclusion pattern
.TP
\fB\-\-memory\-mib\fR \fI<MIB>\fR
Whole\-process memory envelope in MiB
.TP
\fB\-\-reduced\-motion\fR
Disable nonessential motion
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\fR \fI<THEME>\fR
Built\-in semantic color theme
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
excise\-dark
.IP \(bu 2
excise\-light
.IP \(bu 2
high\-contrast
.IP \(bu 2
monochrome
.IP \(bu 2
dracula
.IP \(bu 2
tokyo\-night
.IP \(bu 2
catppuccin\-mocha
.IP \(bu 2
catppuccin\-latte
.IP \(bu 2
gruvbox\-dark
.IP \(bu 2
gruvbox\-light
.IP \(bu 2
nord
.IP \(bu 2
solarized\-dark
.IP \(bu 2
solarized\-light
.IP \(bu 2
one\-dark
.IP \(bu 2
monokai
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-ascii\fR
Use ASCII\-only symbols and borders
.TP
\fB\-\-mouse\fR
Enable mouse capture and selection
.TP
\fB\-\-keymap\fR \fI<PRESET>\fR
Keyboard preset. Arrows and safety keys always work
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
vim
.IP \(bu 2
custom
.IP \(bu 2
emacs
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR
Output mode. Table and JSON never acquire a terminal
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
tui
.IP \(bu 2
table
.IP \(bu 2
json
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Write a noninteractive report to FILE instead of stdout
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-disable\-delete\-confirmation\fR
Do not ask for confirmation before deleting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fIfolder\fR]
Folder to scan
.SH VERSION
v1.0.2
